    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d521-a1">

                <pb facs="0970" n="846" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg846"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gosper to Mr.
                            Bell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Department, Territory of
                            Arizona</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 26,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your communication of the 3d instant, inclosing copy of a note from the
                    minister of Mexico calling attention to the violation of the treaty between the
                    United States and Mexico, in that a sheriff of one of the counties of this
                    Territory had crossed the boundary line and arrested a fugitive criminal and
                    took him from Mexican territory without complying with the formalities of the
                    extradition treaty. In answer, would say that the proper steps shall be taken to
                    ascertain the facts of the case.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN J. GOSPER,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                        Governor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
